<title>CHINA: SOCCER-RESULTS OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE GAMES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS OF CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the first round games of China's professional soccer league played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an     0   Sichuan Quanxing   0</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua   2   Yanbian Aodong     0</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	 2   Vanguard Huandao   0</p>
<p> August First	 1   Tianjin Lifei	0</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu     1   Jinan Taishan	0</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo   1   Guangdong Hongyuan 0</p>
</text>
